Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.43,0:23:32.93,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}看吧 這一切都如初
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.93,0:23:40.40,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}一如平常 你的描摹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:44.32,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}玻璃般的線條略過
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:49.99,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}看吧 這些恢復如初
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:56.08,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}細碎但總能有一日
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.83,0:24:04.17,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}我也不明 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.17,0:24:11.76,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}魔法現在 藏哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:19.90,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}捉迷藏 繼續看吧
